{
  "description": "X-Memex-UTC-Offset cases (D5, D10a). Grammar: ^[+-]\\d{2}:\\d{2}$, minutes 00-59, magnitude at most 14:00. valid: header -> signed minutes the parser returns. invalid: headers the parser rejects. format: signed minutes -> the one header the formatter writes (zero is +00:00). Owned by #74; #76 (Rust) and #77 (Dart) must pass it unchanged.",
